{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1889801655"}, "name":{"label":"An IT technician of 10 years"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-11T09:11:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"13738261621"}, "title":{"label":"Never stops promoting you to upgrade"}, "content":{"label":"Every time you open the widget you are prompted to upgrade to paid and then keeps popping up prompting you to upgrade with anything touched. I miss when free apps were free", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1064230501"}, "name":{"label":"SCT-NC"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-10T07:36:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"13734412242"}, "title":{"label":"Works Well But Weird as Widget"}, "content":{"label":"I keep a Sticky Widgets on my Home Screen on my iPhone 16.  I keep a short list of appointments and to-dos. However, when I open and update the widget (which I do daily), the changes take within the app but when I close it, the on-screen widget shows the old information.  \n\nIt  significantly limits its usefulness to me since I have to open the widget to see the updated information and cannot just glance at it on my home page screen to see what’s going on. \n\nI also don’t understand why I can’t delete unwanted stickies. The only option is to archive them. I have tons archived when I first used it and unwittingly made many blank and useless stickies. \n\nThese are my complaints, which I  provide, I hope, as constructive criticism.   It is still a great app.  I am a sound tech and it’s useful for entering a performer’s equipment needs and stage plot, making it  easy to pull up and implement the information at the gig without scrolling through multiple emails that may or may not contain the info.  This is just on example of its many uses. \n\nIt’s a great app that could be greater. \n\n\n.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
