{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id6721325"}, "name":{"label":"Drob800"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-09T06:42:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"13493834474"}, "title":{"label":"Counterintuitive"}, "content":{"label":"It is difficult to change existing notes.  It’s great to have a list displayed on the home screen but that list needs to be easily edit able. Also how do I make it display the beginning of the list rather than the end?  Reordering tasks is difficult.  \nOverall hard to use and not enough instructions. \nI want to see the first/top items displayed on the Home Screen. Tap a button to open the note/ list and then tap another a button to open the note in an editing screen. I want to be able to add, change, and remove tasks and then rearrange them in order the way I want. \nIf this app can do all of these things, then please make the instructions easy to find.  I’m signed up to pay for the app but can’t use it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
