{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1397718079"}, "name":{"label":"Frenchiemom70"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-02T13:17:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13348482297"}, "title":{"label":"All my sticky notes are blank now 😫"}, "content":{"label":"I absolutely loved this app so much I  actually pay for it. I use it daily to save scriptures and things I want to share with others and help remind myself of things. I had so many important things saved and one day I went to open the app, and ALL my notes are there, but completely blank. I did nothing- so not sure what happened. I have searched for fixes, called apple support 3 times with no luck. I reached out to the app developer and am desperately hoping I will hear something back and my info can restored/recovered. Major bummer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
