{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37071352"}, "name":{"label":"JPA73"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-07T04:59:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13235336489"}, "title":{"label":"Won’t pin to screen"}, "content":{"label":"I really like the idea. The main reason for purchasing this app was so my to-do list would be pinned to my screen so it was always there for me to see.\n\nUnfortunately after the first day it stopped pinning to locked screen on my iPhone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id101779947"}, "name":{"label":"Jeanjacket"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-29T21:02:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.0"}, "id":{"label":"13203064959"}, "title":{"label":"Quick notes no longer possible. Remove forced note naming."}, "content":{"label":"The speed and simplicity of this app is what makes it great. I use the widget when I need to take a very quick note and put my phone away. The iOS 26 update inexplicably came with a requirement to name a note before it will save. It will NOT let you skip this step, and if you try, it will delete any changes you made to the note without warning you to save them. Not acceptable. There is no pragmatic purpose served by forcing a note to be named in order to save the content and thoroughly detracts from the fundamental purpose and function of using this app over something more full featured (like Notes). Please revert this change.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1533254320&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
